!
! This database stores the name-alias for database conversion.
! Format: original name followed by alias, seperated by semicolon ";"
! If the species name does not include blank space, you can also use 
! blank space as separator.
! e.g., Bunsenite(alpha) ; Bunsenite_a
! e.g., Bunsenite(beta)  ; Bunsenite_b
! e.g., Bunsenite(gama)    Bunsenite_c
! The alias can be useful for the program that can not support long name
! as automatically truncation by the program sometimes make the name meaningless.
!
! Please note that the maximum length for the name/alias is 60 characters each.
! The database is free form, name and alias are separated by space (no matter how many blank spaces).
! The maximum line length is 260 characters.
! All the name and alias is case-insensitive.
!
! Line start with "!" is comment line. Skip in reading.
! 
